  "ruleText": "He-W 404.03 Distribution of Intercepted Lottery Prizes. Intercepted amounts shall be distributed in accordance with He-W 403.\n\nSource. #6393, eff 12-4-96, EXPIRED: 12-04-04\n\nNew. #8416, INTERIM, eff 8-23-05, EXPIRES: 2-19-06; ss by #8541, eff 2-20-06; renumbered by #9206 (formerly He-W 404.04); ss by #10645, eff 7-22-14, EXPIRED: 7-22-24\n\nNew. #14127, INTERIM, eff 11-26-24, EXPIRES: 5-25-25 (Remains in effect per RSA 541-A:14-a); ss by #14276, eff 6-24-25, EXPIRES: 6-24-35",
